:[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["一罐花生酱几十元。每周喂几次，顺手就做。加之前要带孩子看一次医生，做个评估。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["英国 LEAP 随机试验。640 名婴儿入组，条件是有重度湿疹、鸡蛋过敏，或者两样都有。入组时 4 到 11 个月大。随机分成两组，一组定期吃花生制品，一组完全回避，到 60 个月大时看花生过敏率。入组时花生皮试阴性的 530 人里，回避组 13.7% 过敏，吃的组 1.9%（P<0.001）。入组时皮试已经弱阳性的 98 人里，回避组 35.3%，吃的组 10.6%（P=0.004）。两组的严重不良事件没有差别。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Du Toit G, Roberts G, Sayre PH, 等 (2015). Randomized trial of peanut consumption in infants at risk for peanut allergy. New England Journal of Medicine, 372(9), 803-813. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1414850","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1414850"]},"；国家卫生健康委办公厅 (2020). 婴幼儿喂养健康教育核心信息. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-08/01/content_5531915.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2020-08/01/content_5531915.htm"]},"；Perkin MR 等 (2016). Randomized Trial of Introduction of Allergenic Foods in Breast-Fed Infants. New England Journal of Medicine, 374(18), 1733-1743. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1514210","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1056/NEJMoa1514210"]},"（备注里那项一般婴儿试验 EAT）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["**形式只能是花生酱调稀或者花生粉拌进辅食，绝不能给整粒花生。**卫健委的喂养核心信息写得很明白：「整粒花生、坚果、果冻等食物易吸入气管，引起窒息，婴幼儿应当避免食用」。噎住了怎么办，不满 1 岁的见第 13 节第 43 条（婴儿噎住哭不出声），1 岁以上的见第 13 节第 26 条（有人噎住说不出话）。适用的只是高危孩子：有重度湿疹，或者已经对鸡蛋过敏的那些。**加之前必须先看医生做评估，不要自己在家试**：LEAP 试验入组前给每个孩子做了皮试。皮试反应大于 4 毫米的孩子被排除在试验之外，没让他们吃。一般孩子的证据弱得多。另一项 1162 名普通母乳喂养婴儿的试验里，按分组算，早引入组食物过敏 5.6%、常规组 7.1%，差别不显著（P=0.32）；只有在真正做到了的那部分孩子里才显著（2.4% 对 7.3%）。这种算法容易把效果说大，作者自己说按分组算没能证出效力，但也说明早引入是安全的。中国的官方喂养文件目前对「该早引入还是该回避易过敏食物」没有说法，所以这条按国际试验证据写。时间点上也要注意：LEAP 从 4 月龄起，而中国是满 6 月龄开始加辅食，见本节第 4 条（前 6 个月只喂母乳）。高危孩子几月龄开始、怎么开始，听医生的。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/20-11"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"大件按「借、买二手、买新」的顺序考虑，别一次性配齐"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/20-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"盯住新生儿黄疸的几个信号：出生 24 小时内就黄、叫不醒不吃奶，就当天去医院；越来越黄、大便发白，就尽快去查"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 1 岁不喂蜂蜜"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 1 岁，不要喂蜂蜜。蜂蜜水、拌进辅食里的蜂蜜、含蜂蜜的糕点，都算。蜂蜜里可能带有引起肉毒中毒的细菌。大人肚子里的菌群能压住它，婴儿压不住。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["出生时的维生素 K 针一定要打"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["新生儿身体里存的维生素 K 很少，不补可能出血，晚出现的那种常常是脑子里出血。塔什干没普遍做这种预防，每 10 万个新生儿有 478 个出这种血。做了预防，估计…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不满 3 个月的婴儿体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院，不在家观察"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["孩子不满 3 个月，体温到 38 ℃ 就直接去医院。不要在家观察，也不要先喂退烧药再等等看。美国儿科学会专门给看着状态还可以的发热婴儿定了处理办法，所以「看着精…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["无论多累多气都不要摇晃婴儿"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["婴儿的头大，脖子没力气。用力摇晃会让他脑子里、眼睛里出血，可能要了他的命，也可能留下一辈子的残疾。哄睡时轻轻晃不算，危险的是控制不住的猛晃。快压不住火时，把孩子…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["尿布不看牌子看三件事：合不合身、换得勤不勤、有没有被抽检通报过"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["没有哪个官方机构排过「哪个牌子最好」。能查的只有两样：市场监管总局的产品质量抽检通报，和监管部门对具体事件的调查。贵的不等于安全，进口的不等于合格。先买小包装试…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/20-14"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["怀孕、喂奶时在吃素，就补维生素 B12 或吃强化食品；孩子的辅食要有动物性食物，非要全素先找医生"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["维生素 B12 几乎只在肉、蛋、奶里有，吃全素的要靠强化食品或补充剂。妈妈吃全素又没补，喂母乳的孩子就容易缺。孩子多在 4 到 8 个月大时出问题：长不大、发育…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/20"},"children":["阅读整个主题：刚出生的孩子怎么带 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l